  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">3. The Swedish International Biodiversity Programme (SwedBio), startades 2002 f&#xf6;r att proaktivt st&#xe4;rka  biodiversitet-fattigdomsfr&#xe5;gor i svenskt utvecklingssamarbete. Samarbetsprogrammet startade 2003 f&#xf6;r att st&#xf6;dja kapacitetsuppbyggnad i Syd genom direkt st&#xf6;d till strategiska biodiversitetsinitiativ. SwedBio samarbpr 2006-07 &#xe4;r en tv&#xe5;&#xe5;rsf&#xf6;rl&#xe4;ngning &#xe1; totalt 39.3 MSEK.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Swedish International Biodiversity Programme (SwedBio) was formed in 2002 to proactively adress biodiversity-livelihoods concerns in Swedish development cooperation. The Collaborative Programme started in 2003 to support capacity building in the South through direct support of strategic biod. initiatives. SwedBio collabpr 2006-2007 is a two year extension of its Collaborative Programme, tot 39.3 MSEK.</narrative>
  </description>
